  "body": "shadow-4.20.3\r\n\r\nRegression fixes:\r\n\r\n-  Build error when using '--with-nscd=no' (bug introduced in v4.19.0).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nShell history of the build of the tarballs:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n 1962  2026-09-23 20:15:45+0200 git clean -dffx\r\n 1963  2026-09-23 20:16:18+0200 ./autogen.sh \r\n 1964  2026-09-23 20:16:37+0200 make -j4\r\n 1965  2026-09-23 20:17:31+0200 make dist\r\n 1966  2026-09-23 20:19:43+0200 gpg --detach-sign --armor shadow-4.20.3.tar.gz \r\n 1967  2026-09-23 20:19:47+0200 gpg --detach-sign --armor shadow-4.20.3.tar.xz \r\n 1968  2026-09-23 20:20:16+0200 git archive -o shadow-4.20.3_src.tar 4.20.3\r\n 1969  2026-09-23 20:20:23+0200 gpg --detach-sign --armor shadow-4.20.3_src.tar \r\n 1970  2026-09-23 20:20:34+0200 gzip -nk shadow-4.20.3_src.tar\r\n 1971  2026-09-23 20:20:43+0200 xz -k shadow-4.20.3_src.tar\r\n 1972  2026-09-23 20:22:05+0200 history\r\n```"
